  "description": "Provides a simple, reliable, and dependency-free currency conversion utility for .NET applications using official daily exchange rates published by the European Central Bank (ECB). Supports conversions between 30+ currencies with automatic caching and clean API design.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
